            "History": "After losing the 2nd World War, The Nazi Regime splintered and went into hiding all around the world. Arnold Hiemler oversaw the South American occult research division and had been discovering ancient temples and cities lost to the jungle when news of the German defeat came. He immediately declared himself supreme leader and began constructing a grand fortress on top of a large ancient city that laid on one of earth's key ley line points. Then Arnold found what he was looking for a long-lost artifact of immense supernatural power, which upon its application opened a portal to another dimension, Hydronia. The entire base and over 50,000 enslaved locals marched through, and the base fell silent for decades, being reclaimed by the rain forest. Then shortly after the Apocalypse on earth the base lit up and the jungle receded as if frightened if its inhabitants. No longer Nazis, calling themselves the children of Hydra, they are agents of the chaos goddess Tiamat and have been living in a pocket dimension created by her to raise and train a mighty army to take over the now shattered world. Adventuring Agents are spies or renegades out in the world gathering intel ahead of the army, they will pose as Friendly heroes and lost soldiers.",
