            "History": "A century before the apocalypse the European government had a secret war with a long lost race of Bridge Trolls, awakened by the breaking of circles and rituals put in place centuries before, through deforestation and development. The trolls were burned and destroyed to the last and their King was caged and enslaved, placed in a ring of fire, locked away deep beneath Britain. Trapped for decades until sold to the UEC, at which point he was tested in every conceivable way. The King was found to be A sexual and so was forced to spawn more test subjects, it was soon discovered that the Trolls Regeneration didn't exist while they were in their birth cocoon and the UEC surgeons removed most of the newborn's brains, those that survived became loyal almost unkillable monsters with the minds of simple small children. The UEC never allows Abominations into the cities nor complexes, they are used primarily in many Wastes bound units and most treat them decent. Adventuring Abominations most likely lost their entire human detail/unit and now must roam the wastes as monsters, some are lucky enough to be found by adventurers before they are forced into madness or cannibalism and can be loyal companions.",
