            "History": "Gemanites are an ancient race of Krystal Symbiotes that have evolved from single cell organism gemstone like creatures that existed on earth since its beginning, staying near the Earth's core. Only rising it surface radiation levels spike, once there they require hosts to survive. The hosts can be anything with a mind. However, they cannot host plant life and have a dramatic effect on the environment, which crystallizes as it is drained of biomass and energy. Ninety Nine percent of all beings infected with a Gemanite become slobbering, hive controlled drones. The host consciousness is literally devoured and no longer exists, there is only the Gemanite in full control of the body. Adventuring Gemanites are the exception, they are beings that once merged, the host's will is stronger and he/she retains control of their body. In these cases the Symbiote is little more than a tool for the host and doesn't exert control over the mind or body.",
